{"4459310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Liquidia", "steam_appid": 4459310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Liquidia</i>—a survival-crafting world built around a single, sacred resource: water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a traveling cat-folk, wandering through forgotten islands where ancient ruins lie sleeping beneath the dust. On your back rests a simple flask. Inside it holds everything you'll ever need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌊 One Resource. Endless Possibilities.</strong><br>No sprawling tech trees. No inventory clutter. Just water—the source of all life, creation, and survival. Gather it. Spend it wisely. Watch your world grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/6af0aba6e038b564be4d4340abe62161.poster.avif?t=1773300774\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/6af0aba6e038b564be4d4340abe62161.webm?t=1773300774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/6af0aba6e038b564be4d4340abe62161.mp4?t=1773300774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐱 A Wanderer's Life</strong><br>By day, you explore. Discover sunken altars, overgrown towers, and remnants of a world long gone. Pour your water into the earth, and the earth remembers—forests rise from wasteland, grass spreads beneath your paws, and the dead awake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By night, you defend. Darkness brings creatures that hunger for what you've built. But you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/5c0727022c713fcc46fde155885ed650.poster.avif?t=1773300774\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/5c0727022c713fcc46fde155885ed650.webm?t=1773300774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/5c0727022c713fcc46fde155885ed650.mp4?t=1773300774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌿 Ruins That Rise Again</strong><br>Every island holds secrets:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/79cd1b92aa063d8beacee813fa2258ab.poster.avif?t=1773300774\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/79cd1b92aa063d8beacee813fa2258ab.webm?t=1773300774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/79cd1b92aa063d8beacee813fa2258ab.mp4?t=1773300774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌞🌙 Two Worlds in One Day</strong><br><i>Liquidia</i> breathes in cycles. Daylight is yours—to wander, build, and prepare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/1fac75ca60d7f5e5fac8c7208093b8cc.poster.avif?t=1773300774\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/1fac75ca60d7f5e5fac8c7208093b8cc.webm?t=1773300774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/1fac75ca60d7f5e5fac8c7208093b8cc.mp4?t=1773300774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Night brings the hunt—monsters rise, and every wall, every tower, every companion you've gathered becomes your shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/15dd9456b29c40783f46865a67b623d6.poster.avif?t=1773300774\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/15dd9456b29c40783f46865a67b623d6.webm?t=1773300774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4459310/extras/15dd9456b29c40783f46865a67b623d6.mp4?t=1773300774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✨ Built for Ease. Crafted for Depth.</strong><br>We made <i>Liquidia</i> for players who want the joy of creation without the grind. Simple controls. Intuitive systems. And a world that rewards every drop you choose to spend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FloatUpGames</strong><br>First game. Pouring from the heart. Coming soon.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Liquidia</i>—a survival-crafting world built around a single, sacred resource: water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a traveling cat-folk, wandering through forgotten islands where ancient ruins lie sleeping beneath the dust. On your back rests a simple flask. Inside it holds everything you'll ever need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌊 One Resource. Endless Possibilities.</strong><br>No sprawling tech trees. No inventory clutter. Just water—the source of all life, creation, and survival. Gather it. Spend it wisely. Watch your world grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loo